d her! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See an orange? You can throw it! Is there a giant cake at the top of a mountain? Hurl it down at your enemies! The world is your plaything, and it’s your only weapon against the waves of monsters you’ll be fighting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/39e1a7f7d6ee67b7edf637d5199490a3.webp?t=1782097005\" width=600 height=50 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/4f9292b48848435beaa7965ab1bd4cae.poster.avif?t=1782097005\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/4f9292b48848435beaa7965ab1bd4cae.webm?t=1782097005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/4f9292b48848435beaa7965ab1bd4cae.mp4?t=1782097005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sorts of monsters inhabit this strange world Mirai finds herself in. Fight hordes of enemies to gain new skills that will help you on your journey! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just don’t linger too long. The portal to the next world won’t stay open forever… </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/extras/41b0588fd95a3945946b14c3c5757745.webp?t=1782097005\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting and colorful handcrafted worlds to explore </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique and silly monsters to face </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique telekinetic fighting style featuring 100+ different objects to control. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense race against the clock in every level. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades and new abilities just waiting to be unlocked </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate aged versions of worlds previously explored </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic and fun voiced lines from the protagonist throughout gameplay </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully hand drawn and fully voice acted cutscenes</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Use your telekinetic powers to hurl watermelons, lamp posts, toilets and more at the monsters roaming this strange yet familiar world. You’ll take the role of Mirai: a young sorceress trying to save her friend from the monsters who’ve abducted her.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/header.jpg?t=1782097005", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782097005", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2735110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782097005", "website": "https://trashfiregames.com/an-eternity-gone-by/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400H @ 2.60GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated Sound Card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> N/A</li></ul>", "recommended": "